/data/
/.idea
# Local env files may hold the model API key. The pattern is deliberately unanchored so it
# covers backend/.env as well as a root .env; only the `*.env.example` templates are committed.
.env
# Backup copies of the same file hold the same key, so they are ignored too -- except the
# committed templates.
.env.*
!.env.example
# Local model credentials must never be committed.
/key.txt
# Cloud database credentials contain a plaintext password: never commit the real file.
# The committed template is database.local.txt.example (for local Docker); the four-line
# format for a self-hosted instance is documented in 部署说明.md §3.1 / §6.
/database.txt
# The local PostgreSQL credentials describe one developer's machine (see pytest-local.ps1
# and start.ps1 -Database local), so they are never committed either.
/database.local.txt
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
*.log
# 一键启动脚本的日志与 PID 记录，属于本机运行状态。
/logs/
/artifacts/
/.runtime/
/.tmp/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
# Isolated git worktrees live here; they are scratch space, never committed.
/.worktrees/
# The manual end-to-end screenshot harness: its input is a conversation captured from a
# running stack and its output is a generated page, so neither is committed. The evidence it
# produces is copied into docs/wealth/.
/frontend/.e2e/
# 飞书扫码临时二维码图片与测试缓存
feishu_qr.png
**/feishu_qr.png
**/pytest-of-*/
